# Project

Family genealogy app (Rafałowscy): React Flow tree + Firestore dashboard.

Read `AGENTS.md` for domain model, routes, and layout rules before larger changes.

## Hotspots

- Tree layout: `src/features/genealogyLayout.ts`
- Relation helpers: `src/entities/relation/helpers.ts`
- Views: `src/views/Home.tsx` (graph), `src/views/Dashboard.tsx` (CRUD)

## Layout intents

- Multi-partner: 1st partner right, 2nd left; one shared person card
- Children of left couple → left; children of right couple → right
- No overlapping sibling / partner / child cards

## Conventions

- Code & commits in English; UI may be Polish
- Match existing styled-components / entity patterns
- Lint with Biome (`npm run lint`)
